        },
        {
          "name": "scope.note.v1.0.0.historical",
          "value": "Draft/runtime SBOM from frozen distribution plus official CPython SBOM and provenance checks. The 2026-10-13 release ZIP was rebuilt with 14 notice files. It records unresolved native version/provenance differences: OpenSSL DLLs 3.5.8 vs official CPython SBOM 3.5.7; sqlite3.dll 3.53.1.0 vs 3.50.4.0; zlib1.dll resource 1.3.2 vs zlib-ng 2.2.4. Do not treat this SBOM as legal clearance. Build-only PyInstaller, hooks, and their transitive dependencies are omitted because they were not found bundled in the release tree. Windows-provided dependencies may remain external. Amendment 2026-10-21: the archive was rebuilt from the same source commit (f93a88b) after the 2026-10-13 artifact was lost with its scratch folder; the release.archive properties now record the rebuilt archive (16,702,642 bytes, SHA-256 3288d64ff81929a72d2f8e6859114cc0c9c2aa83b250578ff91ae6e222ddff5c, 1,013 entries, integrity check passed, smoke test passed). The component inventory is unchanged: the rebuild used the same CPython 3.14.7 archive and Tcl/Tk MSI, whose hashes were verified at build time against docs/packaging.md. Per-DLL hashes recorded in this SBOM were measured on the 2026-10-13 tree."
        },
        {
          "name": "release.archive.size.bytes",
          "value": "17398639"
        },
        {
          "name": "release.archive.entries",
          "value": "1029"
        },
        {
          "name": "release.archive.integrity",
          "value": "pass: ZipFile.testzip returned null"
        },
        {
          "name": "release.smoke.status",
          "value": "passed: exact-ZIP gate completed by automated Light full workflow with exit code 0 and owner desktop attestation (2026-10-23): Open selected opened the attached synthetic PDF in Chrome PDF viewer, the owner captured Night-theme Screening, and the app closed normally. See docs/release-gate-2.0.0.md."
        },
        {
          "name": "scope.note",
          "value": "Phase 1 v2.0.0 package: 1,029 entries and ZIP integrity passed; ten TTF files and sixteen notices verified. Builder and independent detached full suites each passed 437 tests on CPython 3.14.2/Tk 8.6.15 and CPython 3.14.7/Tk 9.0.4. The earlier real-profile WAL incident was closed by owner-directed backup and transactional deletion; the import event was retained and integrity_check passed. Final packaged UI gate passed on 2026-10-23 based on the automated Light run and owner desktop check; see docs/release-gate-2.0.0.md. The CRT pair is byte-identical to v1.0.0 and entitlement carries under the owner ruling; the UCRT/API-set delta is attributed to build-host Windows SDK/UCRT variance and the v1 Windows SDK basis. No other runtime change. Inherited OpenSSL, SQLite, and zlib provenance questions remain subject to Cinder review; post-push review remains pending before tag or release."
        }
      ]
    }
